Package: ventulusd
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, kmod
Suggests: lm-sensors, dkms
Description: Hardware fan control daemon for Linux (OpenFan, hwmon, GPU)
 ventulusd controls PC fans through an OpenFAN controller, motherboard
 fan headers (hwmon) and AMD GPU firmware fan curves. The Ventulus GUI and
 the ventulus-tray panel client talk to it over a local socket.
 .
 It gives every fan header back exactly as it found it whenever it stops,
 and forces full speed on a thermal emergency whatever profile is active.
